VALUES (13225, 'tt0104254', NULL, 'FernGully: The Last Rainforest', 'FernGully: The Last Rainforest', 'movie', 1992, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkJxdeaibcrcsi1XHvT0IuOjdzB.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2GBUz0Z4YyKi2ojHylPIT6yBBl1.jpg', 'When a sprite named Crysta shrinks a human boy, Zak, down to her size, he vows to help the magical fairy folk stop a greedy logging company from destroying their home: the pristine rainforest known as FernGully. Zak and his new friends fight to defend FernGully from lumberjacks — and the vengeful spirit they accidentally unleash after chopping down a magic tree.', NULL, NULL, 3.7363, 6.406, 0, 3.22111111111111085e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-10-20 23:15:30')
